{'symbol': 'BIIB', 'date': '2022-06-21 06:37:00', 'title': 'EUROPEAN PATENT OFFICE GRANTS PATENT RELATED TO TECFIDERA® (DIMETHYL FUMARATE)', 'text': 'CAMBRIDGE, MASS., JUNE 21, 2022 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- BIOGEN INC. (NASDAQ: BIIB) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT THE EUROPEAN PATENT OFFICE HAS GRANTED A PATENT THAT EXPIRES IN FEBRUARY 2028 RELATED TO TECFIDERA ® (DIMETHYL FUMARATE). THE PATENT, EP 2 653 873, IS DIRECTED TO TREATING MULTIPLE SCLEROSIS USING DIMETHYL FUMARATE DOSED AT 480MG PER DAY, WHICH IS THE EUROPEAN MEDICINES AGENCY (EMA) RECOMMENDED MAINTENANCE DOSE FOR TECFIDERA.'}